Mapon GO is a new and improved version of the Mapon driver mobile application and is available to all registered Mapon platform users. It's still at an early stage of development and offers only a fraction of the features currently available on Mapon GO. However, we're expecting to expand the functionality of Mapon GO in the future. What's more, the new app already offers such added benefits as GPS tracking, as well as enhanced overall application speed and design for better user experience.     
The Mapon GO application is an effective tool capable of improving overall business efficiency. It gives the opportunity for drivers to communicate and exchange important information with the back-office in a digitised space. Less paper, faster communication, easy information access and more!

 FEATURES:
* Dashboard - for easy overview and access to relevant information;
* Messaging - for keeping in touch with the back office, forwarding tasks and making sure no files, orders or pictures go missing;
* Mobile tracking - provides built-in mobile tracker functionality; 
* Route history - a complete log with all of the driver's previous travels;
* Settings - for easy set-up and customisation;
* Login.

EasyWay mobile – current public transport routes in your mobile

Service is provided in:
 - Bulgaria (Sofia, Burgas, Pleven, Plovdiv, Varna);
 - Croatia (Zagreb);
 - Kazakhstan (Astana, Almaty);
 - Moldova (Chisinau, Tiraspol, Bender, Balti);
 - Serbia (Belgrade);
 - Ukraine (56 major cities);
 - Uzbekistan (Tashkent).

GPS data is available in the largest cities of Ukraine, Moldova (Chisinau) and Bulgaria (Varna). Partial coverage is possible

Features:
 - Offline-mode;
 - Optimal A to B route search;
 - Full list of current public transport routes, display-on-the-map possibility in the provided cities
 - Route scheme, schedule or interval, service time and travel cost;
 - GPS tracking of your movement;
 - Public Transport GPS-data for selected cities;
 - Real-time Stop schedule and Route direction;
 - Bookmarks, Cities and Routes Cache for traffic optimization;
 - Information on wheelchair accessible transport;
 - Multi-language interface.

The next generation parking app, equipped with innovative features and an exclusive Smart Parking Network is now live. Are you looking for a parking space or do you want to rent yours out? Vicky is here for you.

By connecting people with our Vicky parking spaces, Vicky prevents parking capacity in inner cities from being unused. Join the community and get exclusive access to our Smart Parking Network, or rent out your unused parking space via our platform.

Features in the app:
- Park direct at Vicky parking spots (with credit card);
- Book and reserve a parking spot for guaranteed parking (with credit card & iDeal);
- Travel safely and park your vehicle entirely contactless at the majority of the Vicky locations;
- Search for parking spots close to your destination;
- Get personal travel advice via our "Last Mile Service" using Uber, public transport or on foot to your destination;
- Add multiple vehicles to your account, free of charge;
- Entrance & exit instructions for every Vicky location;
- Subscribe to a fixed parking space at one of our locations;
- Rent out your own parking space, and always determine your own price and availability;
- Flawless Parking Management via our app and easy to integrate with our software in the cloud.

Vicky is developed by people who believe in the possibilities of cities and their inhabitants. The best results are achieved within communities when we all contribute to a common goal. Our goal is to provide a sustainable solution to the structural parking problems in our cities.

CTM BusFinder is the Official App of CTM SpA that guides you during your trips in the Area of Cagliari.

Through the App, CTM does not access to any of your  personal data stored in the device.

With CTM BusFinder you can:
- Read the last news retrieved from the CTM site and Twitter account;
- See the route of the bus lines on the map with the list of bus stops and schedules;
- Plan your journey to reach your destinations  and see the details about the relevant bus stops;
- See the bus stops around you or in a selected area of interest;
- Consult the real-time data about the next bus transits and the relevant routes with reference to a bus stop of interest, also using a QR code reader; 
- See the list of ticket shops around you or in a selected area of interest;
- Manage a list of preferred bus stops for a quick access;
- Purchase CTM single and season electronic tickets;
- Validate electronic tickets by scanning QR codes in CTM buses.
